# Samsung Galaxy Book 10.6 (SM-W620, product "Galaxy Book 10.6") and
# Galaxy Book 10.6 LTE (SM-W627, product "Galaxy Book 10.6 LTE"):
# K2HH accelerometer (ACPI SAM0201)
#
# Matrix relative to the casing in its natural landscape position (keyboard
# cover at the bottom), SM-W627, 2026-11-10. Standing in that position the
# sensor reads x ~ 0, y ~ -0.8 g, z ~ +0.6 g: y already has the sign that
# iio-sensor-proxy calls "normal", z has the opposite sign of the expected
# frame, and with the identity matrix the two portrait positions came out
# swapped on the device (picture upside down in portrait, right in both
# landscape positions). The sensor is therefore turned 180 degrees around
# its y axis: x and z are negated.
# (The firmware ROTM tables are relative to the portrait-native panel and must
# not be used here.)
sensor:modalias:acpi:SAM0201*:dmi:*:svnSAMSUNGELECTRONICSCO.,LTD.:pnGalaxyBook10.6*
 ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX=-1, 0, 0; 0, 1, 0; 0, 0, -1
